            "pdf_page": 39,
            "printed_page": 39
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "I'm not saying it! This will says that the purana of your divine games is over! I've come to tear to shreds the curtain you hung before the townspeople. What do you say? Hmm... leave respectfully!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
