        "source_occurrence_id": null,
        "source_locator": null,
        "speaker_label": "மல்",
        "speaker_label_origin": "source-explicit",
        "source_delimiter": ":-",
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 40,
            "printed_page": 40
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Kumara! You must know by heart the list of those who have crumpled at the movement of my little finger!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "naam-en-s024-u032",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "scene_id": "naam-s024",
      "scene_ordinal": 24,
      "source_scene_number": 24,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/naam/dialogues/records/scene-024.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/naam/scenes/scene-024.md",
        "source_record_id": "naam-s024-d031",
        "source_occurrence_id": null,
        "source_locator": null,
        "speaker_label": "கும",
        "speaker_label_origin": "source-explicit",
        "source_delimiter": ":-",
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 41,
            "printed_page": 41
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "It's because I know it by heart that I haven't forgotten, fool—listen! Parasites like you have been blown away by the furious breath of workers! Here... is the cry of rights that will bring an end to the durbar of your jungle king, hunted by the people of the land! The sledgehammer that will strike you down! What do you say? Why do you stare? Yield that came without sweating! Pleasure that came without hardship! Ecstasy that came without labour! How can you leave all that behind? It will be a little hard! Are you trembling because your 'right' is being snatched away?",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": [
          "The worker/rights rhetoric and repeated unearned-wealth imagery are kept direct rather than neutralized into summary."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "naam-en-s024-u033",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "scene_id": "naam-s024",
      "scene_ordinal": 24,
      "source_scene_number": 24,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/naam/dialogues/records/scene-024.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/naam/scenes/scene-024.md",
        "source_record_id": "naam-s024-d032",
        "source_occurrence_id": null,
        "source_locator": null,
        "speaker_label": "மல்",
        "speaker_label_origin": "source-explicit",
        "source_delimiter": ":-",
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 41,
            "printed_page": 41
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Even if I die, I'll order that even my corpse be buried here. If you have a right, don't come here roaring and babbling!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "naam-en-s024-u034",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "scene_id": "naam-s024",
      "scene_ordinal": 24,
      "source_scene_number": 24,
      "source": {
        "source_path": "works/naam/dialogues/records/scene-024.json",
        "canonical_scene_path": "works/naam/scenes/scene-024.md",
        "source_record_id": "naam-s024-d033",
        "source_occurrence_id": null,
        "source_locator": null,
        "speaker_label": "கும",
        "speaker_label_origin": "source-explicit",
        "source_delimiter": ":-",
        "page_provenance": [
          {
            "pdf_page": 41,
            "printed_page": 41
          }
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Didn't your feet walk on the hearts of the poor, making them a cotton mattress? Wasn't the groan of the poor man's heart music to you? Aren't you the one who squeezed the blood of the helpless like grape juice and drank it! We'll meet before the law!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
